#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.rst:2
msgid "naninterp"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:1
msgid "Linearly interpolate NaN values between valid values."
msgstr "有効値の間にある NaN 値を線形補間します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:3
msgid ""
"This function replaces each NaN value lying strictly between two valid "
"(non-NaN) values along the specified dimension with its linear "
"interpolation.  For a NaN at position :math:`t` whose nearest valid "
"neighbors are at position :math:`p` (before, with value :math:`v_p`) and "
"position :math:`n` (after, with value :math:`v_n`), the result is:"
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿って、2 つの有効値（NaN でない値）に厳密に挟まれた各 NaN 値を、その線形補間で置き換えます。位置 :math:`t` にある NaN について、直前の有効な隣接値の位置を :math:`p`、その値を :math:`v_p`、直後の有効な隣接値の位置を :math:`n`、その値を :math:`v_n` とすると、結果は次のようになります:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:10
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"y[t] = v_p + (v_n - v_p) \\cdot \\frac{t - p}{n - p}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"y[t] = v_p + (v_n - v_p) \\cdot \\frac{t - p}{n - p}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:13
msgid ""
"Leading and trailing NaN values, which lack a valid neighbor on one side,"
" remain NaN.  Valid values are returned unchanged.  This matches "
"``Series.interpolate(method=\"linear\", limit_area=\"inside\")`` of "
"pandas and differs from pandas' default ``interpolate()``, which also "
"forward-fills trailing NaN values."
msgstr "片側に有効な隣接値を持たない先頭および末尾の NaN 値は、NaN のまま残ります。有効値は変更されずにそのまま返されます。これは pandas の ``Series.interpolate(method=\"linear\", limit_area=\"inside\")`` と一致し、末尾の NaN 値まで前方補完してしまう pandas のデフォルトの ``interpolate()`` とは異なります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:20
msgid ""
"The input tensor containing values to be interpolated.  Must be a "
"floating point tensor."
msgstr "補間する値を含む入力テンソル。浮動小数点テンソルである必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:24
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to interpolate. Default is -1 (the last "
"dimension)."
msgstr "補間を行う次元。デフォルトは -1 で、最後の次元を意味します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:28
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as the input, with interior NaN values "
"replaced by linear interpolations.  Leading and trailing NaN values "
"remain NaN."
msgstr "入力と同じ形状のテンソルで、内側（有効値に挟まれた区間）の NaN 値は線形補間で置き換えられます。先頭および末尾の NaN 値は NaN のままです。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:33
msgid "If ``x`` is not a floating point tensor."
msgstr "``x`` が浮動小数点テンソルでない場合。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:36
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:38
msgid ""
">>> QF.naninterp(torch.tensor([0.0, nan, nan, 3.0]))\n"
"tensor([0., 1., 2., 3.])"
msgstr ">>> QF.naninterp(torch.tensor([0.0, nan, nan, 3.0]))\ntensor([0., 1., 2., 3.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:41
msgid ""
">>> # Leading and trailing NaNs remain NaN.\n"
">>> QF.naninterp(torch.tensor([nan, 1.0, nan, 2.0, nan]))\n"
"tensor([   nan, 1.0000, 1.5000, 2.0000,    nan])"
msgstr ">>> # 先頭と末尾の NaN は NaN のままになります。\n>>> QF.naninterp(torch.tensor([nan, 1.0, nan, 2.0, nan]))\ntensor([   nan, 1.0000, 1.5000, 2.0000,    nan])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:45
msgid ""
">>> # 2D example with dim=1\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [10.0, nan, 20.0]])\n"
">>> QF.naninterp(x, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([[ 1.,  2.,  3.],\n"
"        [10., 15., 20.]])"
msgstr ">>> # dim=1 を指定した 2 次元の例\n>>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, nan, 3.0],\n...                   [10.0, nan, 20.0]])\n>>> QF.naninterp(x, dim=1)\ntensor([[ 1.,  2.,  3.],\n        [10., 15., 20.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:52
msgid ""
"Infinite values are treated as valid values and are kept as is. A gap "
"adjacent to a ±inf neighbor is filled following IEEE 754 arithmetic; "
"e.g., interpolating between a finite value and inf yields inf or NaN "
"depending on the direction."
msgstr "無限大の値は有効な値として扱われ、そのまま保持されます。±inf に隣接するギャップは IEEE 754 演算に従って埋められます。例えば、有限値と inf の間の補間は、方向に応じて inf または NaN になります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:58
msgid ":func:`ffill`: Forward fill missing values."
msgstr ":func:`ffill`: 欠損値を前方補完する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:59
msgid ":func:`bfill`: Backward fill missing values."
msgstr ":func:`bfill`: 欠損値を後方補完する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:60
msgid ":func:`fillna`: Replace NaN/infinity values with fixed numbers."
msgstr ":func:`fillna`: NaN および無限大の値を固定値に置換する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.naninterp.naninterp:61
msgid ":func:`nanema`: Exponential moving average skipping NaN values."
msgstr ":func:`nanema`: NaN 値をスキップする指数移動平均関数。"

